      "id": 1,
      "text": "Milton was originally named Prairie du Lac and settled in 1838 by Joseph Goodrich, who moved from Alfred, New York for religious and educational reasons.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
